  "question": {
    "text": "Given the data at $25^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}$,\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{Ag}+\\mathrm{I}^{-} \\longrightarrow \\mathrm{AgI}+\\mathrm{e}^{-} ; \\mathrm{E}^{\\circ}=0.152 \\mathrm{~V} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{Ag} \\longrightarrow \\mathrm{Ag}^{+}+\\mathrm{e}^{-} ; \\quad \\mathrm{E}^{\\circ}=-0.800 \\mathrm{~V}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nWhat is the value of $\\log \\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{sp}}$ for $\\mathrm{AgI}$ ?\n$$\n\\left(2.303 \\frac{R T}{F}=0.059 \\mathrm{~V}\\right)\n$$"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "\n$-8.12$\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
